; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 32. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_explorer'
pyCD_explorer.dialogstring_08C259! `[BOR:D][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1E]Explorer: Traps are[N]scattered through the[N]ruins to prevent people[N]from entering.[FIN]There's a story that says[N]this room has a mechanism[N]that reacts to sound…[FIN]Don't make any loud[N]noises, even by mistake.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08F4B1! `[DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:10]A voice echoes in your[N]head.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I have been waiting all of[N]this time for this moment[N]to come.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Make no mistake. I am[N]Shadow; the ultimate[N]warrior, produced by the[N]comet's light.[FIN]My body is formless…[FIN]You may think of it as[N]what a human becomes when[N]only their consciousness[N]evolves.[FIN]The comet that is now[N]nearing the Earth is also[N]a formless body of pure[N]consciousness.[FIN]Only my body can oppose[N]the destruction-bringing[N]comet.[FIN]Well, you should close[N]your eyes…[END]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E66C! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Thy Power of Darkness has[N]grown since Angkor Wat.[WAI][N]Stand before the statue[N]to the right, and thou[N]canst take Shadow's[N]formless shape.[WAI][N]Though born of ancient[N]light, Shadow turned from[N]its path and fought beside[N]the Dark Knights.[WAI][N]Take his form, but let thy[N]will remain thine own.[FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E7E7! `[DEF][CLR][DLY:9]Got the Ball of Aura![PAU:78][DLY:FE][FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E722! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]The Ball of Aura is[N]the heart that anchors[N]Shadow's form.[FIN]When raised, it lets[N]Shadow flow like water.[FIN]The Pyramid visible above[N]the sand is only a[N]fragment; most of it[N]sleeps below.[FIN]Shadow can reach the[N]buried chambers.[FIN]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCC_entrance_portal'
pyCC_entrance_portal.dialogstring_08B70D! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]The Pyramid's entrance is[N]vaguely reflected in the[N]blue light…[WAI][N][PAL:0] Leave it be[N] Jump inside`
pyCC_entrance_portal.dialogstring_08B74B! `[CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'pyDA_lithograph1'
pyDA_lithograph1.dialogstring_08C7C9! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]An engraved slate is[N]stored in the wall.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Is this the form of[N]writing called[N]"hieroglyphics" that I[N]heard of in Dao…?[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]You removed the engraved[N]slate and took it with[N]you.[FIN]`
pyDA_lithograph1.dialogstring_08C831! `[CLD][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][SFX:0][DLY:9]Got the engraved[N]hieroglyphic slate![PAU:70][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039C8B! `[DEF]There's no place to put[N]the hieroglyph plate.[PAL:0][END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_jackal'
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA11! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Be a good boy and stand[N]to the left…!![END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA36! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]I said, stand to the[N]left…!![END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA5A! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Alright, that's good. Stay[N]still just like that…!![END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BA7D! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Jackal: You, sir,[N]have been showing me[N]everything you've done[N]from start to finish.[FIN]I hear that you have[N]biotechnology from[N]millennia ago that uses[N]the light of the comet…[FIN]You're something[N]unbelievable, aren't you?[FIN]You could get whatever you[N]wanted if you had that[N]shapeshifting power.[FIN]Humans would kneel before[N]you.[FIN]Even if King Edward[N]started to act out of[N]desperation, it's not[N]without reason…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Father's behind[N]this?![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Jackal: That's[N]right! It's the king[N]behind it in the end.[FIN]He'll use any means[N]necessary to gain power.[FIN]Maybe he's even crueler[N]than an assassin like me.[N]Mweheheh.[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: Stop it…! Don't say[N]that kind of thing!![FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Jackal: Well,[N]whatever he does, I'm fine[N]as long as I get paid.[FIN]Now, if you'll come to[N]Edward Castle with me.[END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BC55! `[DEF]A voice whispers in Will's[N]mind[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Gaia: Will[AD] Play the[N]flute[AD][N]Trust what answers.[END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BCBC! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: Come any closer[N]and this knife moves[AD][END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BC9F! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Jackal: [N]Give up...? [N][PAL:0][END]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BCF2! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:0]Jackal:[N]Uwhaaaaaaaagh!![PAU:3C][CLD]`
pyCD_jackal.dialogstring_08BD16! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:4]Kara… Kar…[PAU:78][CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_kara'
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BE66! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Kara: Will…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:2]Why can't everyone help[N]but kill each other…?[FIN]I…[PAU:3C] Still…[END]`
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BEA9! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Kara: I'm sorry…[N]I lost my composure…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]I'm persevering so that[N]you can save the world,[N]you know?[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Although Dad must have[N]been searching for me when[N]I started out on this[N]journey…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]Somehow things have become[N]terrible, haven't they…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1][DLY:0]But, as for me, I'm not[N]regretting coming along on[N]this journey.[FIN]Well, I'll see you later.[N]Search for the 5th Mystic[N]Statue…[END]`
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BF8F! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: That melody you[N]played[AD] It sounded almost[N]like a funeral song for[N]Jackal.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_039BA5! `[DEF][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]There are six hollows[N]where a tile can fit. [FIN]Put it where?[N] 1st from L. 4th from L.[N] 2nd from L. 5th from L.[N] 3rd from L. 6th from L.`
item_use_system.dialogstring_039C39! `[CLR][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Inserted the hieroglyph[N]slate into the[N]indentation![END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_puzzle'
pyCD_puzzle.dialogstring_08CCC4! `[DEF]Nothing happens[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](Did I get the order[N]wrong? I should try again[N]from the beginning.)[END]`
pyCD_puzzle.dialogstring_08CD0B! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Wow… Some kind of sound[N]came from just past the[N]entrance![END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCC_portal'
pyCC_portal.dialogstring_08CDDA! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]The mummified queen of the[N]Pyramid is projected in[N]the blue light…[WAI][N][PAL:0] Leave it alone[N] Jump inside`
pyCC_portal.dialogstring_08CE10! `[CLD]`

?INCLUDE 'pyDD_mystic_statue'
pyDD_mystic_statue.dialogstring_08CE60! `[SFX:10][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:10]After you defeated the[N]Pyramid's guardian god,[N]you found a Mystic Statue[N]from their corpse!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'pyCD_kara'
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08BFC7! `[DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2]You could hear a voice[N]from your flute![FIN][CLD][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3]It was the same voice that[N]you heard at Edward[N]Castle's prison…[FIN][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:1]Flute: You've managed to[N]stay strong, haven't you,[N]Will.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0][DLY:1]Will: Dad?![FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme23][DLY:1]Flute: I'm now at the[N]Tower of Babel. Please[N]take the five Mystic[N]Statues and come here.[FIN]The puppets that you had[N]collected until now are[N]holding the key to the[N]fate of mankind;[FIN]…whether humanity lives or[N]dies.[FIN]The comet is approaching…[N]Will… Hurry, hurr. y…[FIN][CLD][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4]The flute's voice[N]ultimately faded away[N]until it could no long be[N]heard…[END]`
pyCD_kara.dialogstring_08C127! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: It seems like[N]something terrible is[N]happening at a place we[N]don't know, huh…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Will: What do we do…?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Even if he suddenly told[N]us to come to the Tower of[N]Babel, going out to a[N]little island on the deep[N]blue sea…[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hey, you know, Neil[N]says that made an[N]aeroplane again.[FIN]It seems that the[N]aeroplane is being brought[N]to the desert town.[FIN]First of all, let's try[N]returning to Dao.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'daC8_neil'
daC8_neil.dialogstring_08A73C! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: You're going no[N]matter what I say, aren't[N]you?[WAI][N]A year ago I'd have called[N]that stubbornness.[WAI][N]Now I know you can make[N]that choice for yourself.[WAI][N]I'll fly you to Babel,[N]then take Kara and Erik[N]back toward South Cape.[WAI][N]And yes, I fixed the[N]aeroplane this time.[N][SFX:A]Probably.[END]`
